{"id":"4b566884cfea35b9","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-post-algebra-basis.md","title":"thm-post-algebra-basis","display":"thm-post-algebra-basis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-post-algebra]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-powers]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]"],"display":"thm-post-algebra-basis","label":"93-thm-post-algebra-basis","aliases":["93-thm-post-algebra-basis"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ce60c713fd9ffed\" href=\"?note=0ce60c713fd9ffed\" title=\"93-df-post-algebra\">93-df-post-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-post-algebra-basis"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-post-algebra-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-post-algebra-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-post-algebra-basis-thm-post-algebra-basis\">thm-post-algebra-basis <code>thm-post-algebra-basis</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P_n\">\\(\\mathbf P_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}\\)</span> are the standard generator and its generated variety from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ce60c713fd9ffed\" href=\"?note=0ce60c713fd9ffed\" title=\"93-df-post-algebra\">93-df-post-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\;\n\\bigl(k\\geq1\\land\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf P_n,k;\\tau_n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\;\n\\bigl(k\\geq1\\land\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf P_n,k;\\tau_n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Finite nontrivial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-valued Post algebras are finite direct powers of the standard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-element chain. The trivial member corresponds to the empty power and is excluded by the carrier-size premise.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-post-algebra-basis-thm-post-algebra-basis","text":"thm-post-algebra-basis `thm-post-algebra-basis`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-post-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"0ce60c713fd9ffed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-post-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"32c4e6b205cc3cd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-powers]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-post-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"0ce60c713fd9ffed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P_n$ and $\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}$ are the standard generator and its generated variety from [[93-df-post-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}basis}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,n}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\;\n\\bigl(k\\geq1\\land\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf P_n,k;\\tau_n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","di